      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After a transaction on a sand dune, Fairy Cui Bo sits on it and flies into the sky. On that same cloud, Ying Wu Xie, using Fairy Cui Bo’s body, laughs before a Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique body explodes and a dream realm engulfs them.",
